{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Bombardiro Crocodilo? Bombombini Gusini vs Bobrito Bandito? What kind of nonsense is this? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN MEME WAR  is a continuation of the legendary MEMOLOGY: MEME WAR game, in which you have to build your personal army of Italian animals and fight against other Italian animals. The genre of the game is survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate your budget, pay attention to the characteristics of the characters, build your meme army and just enjoy this madness. We hope that you have gone through all the parts of MEMOLOGY and become the best meme commander! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player and multiplayer, designed for up to 4 people </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 different and unique battle locations  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Legendary Italian brainrot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable battle speed  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thoughtful story campaign for even more meaningful gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sheer madness and unpredictability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So which Italian animal will win?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852580?t=1756235707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852580?t=1756235707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/d29393444f24d88b41c07684f273d5eef538eef0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756235707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/d29393444f24d88b41c07684f273d5eef538eef0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756235707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Bombardiro Crocodilo? Bombombini Gusini vs Bobrito Bandito? What kind of nonsense is this? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN MEME WAR  is a continuation of the legendary MEMOLOGY: MEME WAR game, in which you have to build your personal army of Italian animals and fight against other Italian animals. The genre of the game is survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate your budget, pay attention to the characteristics of the characters, build your meme army and just enjoy this madness. We hope that you have gone through all the parts of MEMOLOGY and become the best meme commander! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player and multiplayer, designed for up to 4 people </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 different and unique battle locations  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Legendary Italian brainrot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable battle speed  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thoughtful story campaign for even more meaningful gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sheer madness and unpredictability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So which Italian animal will win?</p>","developers":["Piece Of Voxel","Gamesforfarm"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/5f7f0627d1b1b15a7daf998b17af7042ee401978/header.jpg?t=1756235707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183363,"mp4":{"480":"http://vide